{"version":1,"content":"<p>「大美人」林青霞昨天（3日）迎來72歲生日。</p><p>她於社交平台分享一組身穿鮮紅上衣、配戴精緻首飾的慶生相片，相中的她對着鏡頭展現燦爛笑容，並在巨紅玫瑰與粉紫色花卉蛋糕前合照。</p><p>她於文中感性寫道：「祝我生日快樂﹗你們對我的祝福都會回向給你們。</p><p>​​​」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T05:46:10.227365+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T05:00:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T13:18:27.435887+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T05:38:39.891141+00:00","content_hash":"765c1502f628d90e6c00a228b5166e5228fda9f5df292ba3eab88bb655b6e67a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}